<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαυαίνω</span></b> , aor.
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.25.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				12.12
			</span></i>, but inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ᾶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					4.4.32
				</span></i>
			:—<i>starve, wither,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.9
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ib. <i><span class="en">
				4.2.11
			</span></i>; <i>to be parched,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψῃ ἀφαυανθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					146
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				896a14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.25.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μὴ ζητῶν τὸν σύαγρον ἀφαυανθῇς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.401e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>grill, roast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				2.19
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαυαίνω.</span>)</div>
